  "description": "Taking the leap into commuting by bike? Want to head further afield? A few hills knocking your confidence? Or just want to cruise? It all starts with a Pulse.\nThe Pulse accommodates your style and transforms your commuting options. The Bafang hub drive motor gives just the right assistance and with it’s 10.4ah internal battery you can hardly tell it’s an eBike… Until you ride it!\nTogether with Shimano 7 speed gearing you’ll arrive on time every time, hills will feel a breeze, and you will grow the limits of your exploration.\nFeature packed, the Pulse is ready to go. Mudguards, rack, heavy duty rear stand, ergo grips, and LCD display. You are ready to ride as soon as you leave the showroom.\nDesigned for safety as well as function, the Pulse is fitted with cable disc brakes and wide 38c semi slick 700c tyres to keep you on the road and under control in all weathers. With all the features and looks of far more expensive bikes, the Pulse really is a premium bike at an incredible price.\nMake the change, find a better way to commute, find out what’s on the other side of that hill, find your Pulse!\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
